Package: MaquerinaMundo
Type: Project
Title: Maquerina Mundo — Solarpunk Dashboard for Plants and Climate
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("Alejandro", "Ines", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny dashboard that relates GBIF houseplant observations to the
    real weather around each observation (Open-Meteo) through interactive charts,
    a map, a climate explorer and a modeled growth index. This file lists the
    app's dependencies so they can be installed with
    pak::local_install_deps() or remotes::install_deps().
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
