    bslib (>= 0.6),
    dplyr,
    DT,
    htmltools,
    leaflet,
    lubridate,
    plotly,
    shiny (>= 1.8)
Suggests:
    jsonlite,
    lintr,
    rgbif,
    shinytest2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
URL: https://manofmanana.shinyapps.io/maquerinamundo/,
